p scythes or the blazing projectiles of the Acolyte, each enemy brings its own deadly weaponry. Anticipate the overpowering barrage of the Carrion Prowler, evade the sweeping lasers of the Asterophore, and focus down the elusive Mnemosynth. Only the truly skilled will reach the sacred Terminus and face off against the vile Hierophant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/extras/e2b33dee2a64f0ebce650217516147c2.avif?t=1783020359\" width=1200 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/extras/aa3af9f8d52daf2a5ed5d65dd3c07298.poster.avif?t=1783020359\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/extras/aa3af9f8d52daf2a5ed5d65dd3c07298.webm?t=1783020359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/extras/aa3af9f8d52daf2a5ed5d65dd3c07298.mp4?t=1783020359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding your favored arms is just the first step on the journey to mastering Marrow Marrow. Each run will bring you more and more in tune with the movement and allow you to traverse more freely and nimbly than you ever thought possible. When gliding through the levels becomes second nature, you become an unstoppable force of vermin annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio.</p>", "short_description": "MASTER YOUR MOVEMENT. VANQUISH THE VERMIN. Experience all the exhilarating high-intensity action you know and love from arena shooters up close and personal in VR. Zero in your aim, hone your movement, outwit the vermin, and soon you’ll be flying through levels leaving a wake of destruction.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Marrow Marrow is a perfect example of how virtual reality can elevate a simple concept into something supremely intense and engaging.”<br>UploadVR<br><br>“VR Reaches New Highs With Marrow Marrow”<br>PixelByteGaming<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/f725fd5293e24ddb52c2fc6a5cc39502a0dd3e04/header.jpg?t=1783020359", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/ff83a1cd73561f702816812d3fe59b021889ad9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783020359", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040710/ff83a1cd73561f702816812d3fe59b021889ad9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783020359", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Network only required for ranked runs and leaderboard access.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Monster Moon"], "publishers": ["Monster Moon"], "demos": [{"appid": 4041420, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1399, "final": 1399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$13.99"}, "packages": [1417348], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "ti